@service = http://localhost:5492
@user = u-1001

### Direct send (in-app + push, idempotent per order and user)
POST {{service}}/orders/SO-1001/notify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "{{user}}", "amount": 18450, "channels": ["inapp", "push"] }

### Business event: salesorder.approved (rules choose channels/recipients)
POST {{service}}/orders/SO-1002/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requesterUserId": "{{user}}", "amount": 184500, "approvedBy": "Rahul Verma" }

### Inbox token for the signed-in user (demo auth header)
GET {{service}}/me/inbox-token
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### Register a push device for the signed-in user
POST {{service}}/me/devices
X-User-Id: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "platform": "android", "token": "demo-fcm-registration-token", "deviceName": "Pixel 8", "appVersion": "1.0.0" }

### Verified webhook events received from the hub
GET {{service}}/webhooks/events
